 all - thank you for your library, it seems to be really helpful 🙏 \n\nWhile I'm able to find permissions for Bluetooth, I don't see any permissions available for Wi-Fi. They are often related with each other so it looks like a missed functionality.\n\nI'm talking about these from `android.Manifest`:\n- `Manifest.permission.ACCESS_WIFI_STATE`\n- `Manifest.permission.CHANGE_WIFI_STATE`\n- `Manifest.permission.NEARBY_WIFI_DEVICES`\n\nWould it be possible to add them to the library?\n\nThanks!","closed_by":{"login":"krzdabrowski","id":36383670,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MzgzNjcw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36383670?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/krzdabrowski","html_url":"https://github.com/krzdabrowski","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krzdabrowski/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krzdabrowski/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krzdabrowski/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krzdabrowski/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krzdabrowski/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krzdabrowski/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krzdabrowski/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krzdabrowski/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/krzdabrowski/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/315/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MohamedRejeb/Calf/issues/315/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}